{"version":1,"content":"<p>蘋果首款摺疊屏手機iPhone Duo於10月23日在澳大利亞和新西蘭正式開售，隨着當地進入發售日，首批預購用户已開始收到新機，並在社交平台分享上手照片。澳大利亞有蘋果直營店，新西蘭則沒有；當地首發情況也因此成為觀察門店現貨供應的一個窗口。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1583456.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T22:39:59.832887+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":125,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T22:27:15+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T22:38:04.525278+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T22:38:04.525278+00:00","content_hash":"e6726d43e33a2036efc6ef68679fe25659199aac2b04052c692b3d3091b26367","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}